#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:146
msgid "<0>Automatic expiry:</0> every room is permanently deleted 7 days after its last activity, whether or not anyone deletes it manually."
msgstr "<0>Automatic expiry:</0> every room is permanently deleted 7 days after its last activity, whether or not anyone deletes it manually."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:140
msgid "<0>Delete now:</0> a facilitator can open Room settings and choose “Delete room” to erase the room, its participants, votes, and history immediately."
msgstr "<0>Delete now:</0> a facilitator can open Room settings and choose “Delete room” to erase the room, its participants, votes, and history immediately."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:95
msgid "<0>Local storage</0>: your last-used display name and the link to your most recent room, so join and create forms can prefill and the home page can offer you the room again. It also remembers if you dismissed the “buy me a coffee” banner, so it stays hidden for a week, and your language choice if you switch languages in the app."
msgstr "<0>Local storage</0>: your last-used display name and the link to your most recent room, so join and create forms can prefill and the home page can offer you the room again. It also remembers if you dismissed the “buy me a coffee” banner, so it stays hidden for a week, and your language choice if you switch languages in the app."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:152
msgid "<0>On your device:</0> clearing this site’s browser storage removes the saved name, recent-room link, and identity cookie."
msgstr "<0>On your device:</0> clearing this site’s browser storage removes the saved name, recent-room link, and identity cookie."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:87
msgid "<0>One identity cookie per room</0> (<1>point_taken_identity</1>): a random token that binds your browser to your seat so your votes and role survive a refresh or reconnect. It is <2>HttpOnly</2>, <3>SameSite=Strict</3>, scoped to that room’s path, and expires within 7 days. It is not an advertising or analytics cookie."
msgstr "<0>One identity cookie per room</0> (<1>point_taken_identity</1>): a random token that binds your browser to your seat so your votes and role survive a refresh or reconnect. It is <2>HttpOnly</2>, <3>SameSite=Strict</3>, scoped to that room’s path, and expires within 7 days. It is not an advertising or analytics cookie."

#: src/components/room/Room.jsx:234
msgid "<0>Only for you</0>, not for your team. Shown once."
msgstr "<0>Only for you</0>, not for your team. Shown once."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:103
msgid "<0>Session storage</0>: a facilitator recovery code is held briefly so it can be shown to you once after a room is created, then removed."
msgstr "<0>Session storage</0>: a facilitator recovery code is held briefly so it can be shown to you once after a room is created, then removed."

